file tally/parse_int.rye the copy's comment carried into the canon, then the module head molted in place under a cairn; C+ 75 -> A+ 98, no code line moved
file caravan/parse_int.rye a regular file among eighteen sibling marks its own room links, now a symlink to ../tally/parse_int.rye
file tools/fixtures/c/copy_lag_scan.sh behind_ceiling 1 -> 0, with the argument for the fall written where the elder fall's argument stands
file tools/fixtures/c/copy_lag_control.sh the ceiling read moved to the top; leg 3 asserts the verdict its ceiling implies rather than a fixed one
file tools/co/copy_lag_witness.rish the assertion renamed to the claim the leg now makes
file tools/fixtures/c/copy_sameness_scan.sh its 20260729 split spoke as now while the tree reads 23, 0, 0; the elder figure kept as testimony, the current one pointed at its successor guard
file tools/gen/chapter/copy_sameness_witness.rish the say lines print the scan's own count rather than a written one; five em dashes to ASCII
file construction/archive/REDS-fold-recital.md a fold line named %614 and linked the %613 shelf; the number was the error
file construction/REDS.md %620 booked and CLOSED; %619 folded out to make room under the bound
file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the walk-back cairn for the in-place molt of a living path with 149 citers
file construction/ITINERARY.md this round's account, elder block folded whole, nib carried
rota_note Water tastes, and taste only works up close. Every finding this lap turned on running something rather than reading about it -- the unheard witness, the two census scans, the guard that already existed, and the control that only failed once the tree actually changed.
scope one in-lane repair landing the last drifting copy of a Tally mark, one control defect found by that repair and closed on a witness, one recital citation repaired, one living path molted in place, two guard headers synced to the tree
status GREEN -- copy_lag 31 behaviors, copy_sameness and its negative, tally_parse_int, caravan/abandon.rye across the new link, reds_citation verdict=ok, tame_style_check and width-check all GREEN on metal. Two reds stand and neither is closable here: stash_record at orphans=34 is %592's seat, unchanged since my last open, and standing_equipment reds while any do. The cold pass closed tree_moved=yes against my own edits, so the hot pass carries this send.
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- tally_caller_map now names 18 of 69 consumer homes while copy_lag covers the drift half properly. Is that guard's remaining seat the PROSE binding alone -- that tally/README.md carries its canon section and saga/README.md points at it -- and should its header say so rather than calling itself the caller map?
